lyrics:
1. Un duto joma dak e piny,
Weruru Ruoth gi duol maber;
Tiurune, pakuru En;
Biuru nyime kendo umor.

2. Nyasaye, ung'e, ni Ruoth maduong'
En kende ma nochweyowa:
Wan kwedhene, okwayowa;
Oyiewa ka rombege.

3. Donjuru ode to gi pak;
Suduru ire ka umor:
Pakuru Nyinge, miye duong',
Timo kamano owinjowa.

4. Paruru ka Nyasaye ober;
Ndalo duto En ong'uon;
To nene chon owach adier,
To ok onyalo lokore.

5. Ber ji gi jomalaika
Gipake to gi miye duong',
Nyasachwia, Wuonwa me Polo,
Gi Wuode kod Roho Maler.

1. Kama Jawar nothona e Yath,
Luok mar richo duto nitie;
Rembe onyal los chunyi mapoth
Nyinge ni duong'.

Chorus:
Nyinge ni duong'!
Nyinge ni duong'!
Rembe noluoko chunya maler;
Nyinge ni duong'!

2. Kuom warruok maduong' kama!
Yesu okelo hawi kuoma;
Nothona e Yath, nogayoa;
Nyinge ni duong'!

3. Soko ma nochwer mowaroa,
Omiya mor kasedonjoe;
Yesu owara, oritoa;
Nyinge ni duong'!

4. Biuru e Soko machwernu;
Keturu chunyu kuom Jawaru:
Yieuru koro noluoku;
Nyinge ni duong'!

1. Neuru Ruoth mar Ruodhi kobiro giduong';
Wakulre mond' walame kuom tich mabeyo duto.
Ogolo joge e richo oriembo wasigu;

Chorus:
Wapak, Wapakuru Emmanuel, Wapak Emmanuel.
Wami nyinge puoch nyaka chieng' kuom ng'wonone maduong'
Herane mondo odag odagi e chunywa,
En e Wuowi ma miderma mowaro piny duto;
Wapak, Wapakuru Emmanuel, Wapak Emmanuel.

2. Mana kaka apaka gingore e nam;
E machal kod wende mawa pako go herane.
Ogolo joge e chandruok ogonyo jomo motwe;

3. Nobedie mor maduong' kuom jomaler mag Ruoth;
Kawana nene kobedo e kom duong'ne mar loch.
Waduto wanawer gi mor kawa dendo nyinge;

1. In Maler adiera! Wuonwa Nyakalaga!
Koro ka gokinyi wawer ka wapakoi;
In Maler adiera! In manyalo duto!
Wuonwa gi Wuode kod Roho Maler!

2. In Maler adiera! jo maler gilami,
Nyaka nene jogi nopakoi ka gimor;
Kendo Malaika gin mopaki chutho,
In nyaka nene, koro nyaka chieng'.

3. In Maler adiera! Wuonwa Nyakalaga!
Onge jo maricho maneno duong'ni kuno;
In Maler, In kendi; onge moro kodi;
Maduong' mwahero, In Maler adier.

4. In Maler adiera! Wuonwa Nyakalaga!
Tichni duto ma ni e piny gi nam gi Polo;
Duto biro paki, In mang'won manyalo;
Wuonwa gi Wuode kod Roho Maler.

1. An adwaro Yesu maloyo fedha;
Bedo ng'ate oloyo mwandu mathoth,
En ma nothona orita maber;
Adwaro bet gi Yesu moloyo;

Chorus:
Kata abedo Ruodh pinje mathoth
Kendo richo notweya;
Bedo gi Yesu oloyo duto
Ma pinyini dimiya.

2. Bedo gi Yesu oloyo pak mar ji;
Naluwe gadieri kendo tiyone,
Yesu oloyo yudo nying maduong',
Adwaro bet gi Yesu moloyo.

3. Yesu ober maloyo gik ma ni e piny,
Omitna ahinya maloyo mor kich,
Orom' chunya pile ok nachandi;
Adwaro bet gi Yesu moloyo.

1. Daheri moloyo, Yesu Kristo,
Ma to e lamona kaluoroi;

Chorus:
Winja e lamona, Miya chuny mar heri,
Heri adier, Ruodha Yesu.

2. Nadwaro mor me piny, Ber kod yu weyo;
Koro ayieni tim dwaroni.

3. Or gi mineno ber, Tuo gi sand;
Gi manyalo yuwaya kuomi pile.

4. Nyaka naa e piny, Pod apaki;
Naheri moloyo ndalo duto.

1. Keduru jo ka Yesu, jokedo mar Kristo;
Keluru kuodi mau, makuru tong' gi luth.
Yesu Jageng'a marwa, otelonwa maber;
Weuru duto luoro, keduru ka mager.

2. Keduru jo ka Yesu, wasigu mawa kwiny;
To Yesu en kokonywa wanyalo loyo en;
Satani en wasigu ma dwaro negowa;
Kwaluwo bang' Ruoth Yesu wabiro hewoe.

3. Keduru jo ka Yesu, ndalo odong' matin;
Tinende wadhi kedo, kiny wadhi weyo lueny.
Mohewo e moyudo i Polo mor mathoth,
To nyaka chieng' e Polo wasiki kodi Ruoth.

1. Ende wadhiuruwa, wan joluenj Kristo,
Msalap Ruoth Yesu e modhi nyimwa.
Ruodhwa e motelonwa ni wasikwa ka;
Ende wadhiuru tinde, wan joluenj Kristo.

Chorus:
Ende wadhiuruwa,
Wan joluenj Kristo,
Msalap Ruoth Yesu
E modhi nyimwa.

2. Ka jo-Kristo timo chir, jo-Satani a;
Wanalo wasigu, ka waikore.
To wapak Jatelowa, mi wamor adier;
Wan jolueny mageno Yesu, e momiwa mor.

3. Wan oganda Ruoth Yesu, Joge maradier;
To jo-Kristo duto gin owetewa;
Ee, wawuotho kaachiel, ok wapogore;
Wan achiel kuom geno, hera, tim maler duto.

4. Kata pinje lokore, duong' mar piny olal,
To Kanisa Yesu chuweyo nyaka chieng';
Tho gi liel ok nyale ngang' Luanda mar Yesu;
Ende wadhiuru tinde, wan joluenj Kristo.

1. Ruoth ni koda e yo duto, Ere gi marem koro?
En Jatenda e piny kae, Nyaka ngimana duto;
Kuwe gi hoch ayudo kuome; Awuotho kode pile;
Kata gi manade yuda, Yesu norita maber.
Kata gi manade yuda, Yesu norita maber.

2. Ruoth ni koda e yo duto, Kata yo obet marach;
Nokonya e temruok duto; Nomiya chiemb chuny maiz
Ka di po tienda dichwanyre, Enojuka gi lueta;
Ka riyo ohewo chunya, Nomiya pi mar ngima.
Ka riyo ohewo chunya, Nomiya pi mar ngima.

3. Ruoth ni koda e yo duto; An awuoro herane,
Mosesingona kar yueyo, Dala mar Nyasaye Wuora;
Anayud ngima mochwere, Ka wuodha me piny rume:
“Ruoth notelona yo duto,” Nobed wenda nyaka chieng'
“Ruoth notelona yo duto,” Nobed wenda nyaka chieng'

1. Chieng' ma chunya dwaro ya, Yesu dokonya;
Ka Satani dwaro loya, en dorit chunya.

Chorus
En dokonywa, en dokonywa,
Yesu oherowa ngang', en dokonywa.

2. Ok anyalo rito chunya, Yesu dikonya;
Kakwayo tekone pile, Yesu dikonya.

3. Yesu oparo nyithinde, en doritogi;
Omor kuom joge moyie, en dokonywa.

4. Ok doweyo chunya lal ngang', Yesu dikonya;
Nong'iewowa gi rembe, Yesu dikonya.

1. Onge moro maduong' ka Yesu,
En olo, En olo;
Onge maromo gi Ruodhwa Yesu,
Kat' achiel, kat' achiel;
Yesu kende noa e Polo,
Yesu kende e Wuod Nyasaye;
Onge moro maduong' ka Yesu,
Kat' achiel, kat' achiel.

2. Onge moro maber ka Yesu,
En olo, En olo;
Onge matiyo kaka Ruoth dwaro,
Kat' achiel, kat' achiel;
Dhano duto gibir' abara;
Dhano duto maro maber ka Yesu,
Kat' achiel, kat' achiel.

3. Onge moro mang'won ka Yesu,
En olo, En olo;
Onge mahero ngang' kaka Yesu,
Kat' achiel, kat' achiel;
Chon nobiro nokonyo dhano;
Koro Ongima, Oritogi;
Onge moro mang'won ka Yesu,
Kat' achiel, kat' achiel.

1. Bedi koda, piny koro oyusona;
Polo to chido, Yesu bed koda;
Ka onge moro ma dikonyaa;
Jakony jochan lwuon, bedi koda

2. Chieng' ndalona to kor' orumon;
Gik ma nagombo tind' okadhona;
Duto manono lokore to otho,
In mak ilokori bedi koda.

3. Pile achando, pile adwari,
In kend' iloyo teko mar Jachien;
b'kend' itera, In midemb an;
E mudho kend' e chieng' bedi koda.

4. Onge ma luoro, In kibet koda;
Eka masira dak oloya ngang';
Teko mar tho gi liel igolo ka,
An bend' anyalogi ka In koda.

5. Chieng' tho inyisa kaka In nitho;
Ka piny ochido Polo ok' otieny;
Piny cha noru, to mudho duto 'rum;
Kangima kat' atho, bedi koda.

1. Rang chunya, Ruoth, ng'i iya tinende;
Tema, Jawarna, non parona be:
Ne ka nitie richo moro kuoma,
Kendo pwodha chutho, miya thuolo.

2. Apaki, Ruoth, kuom luoka gi rembi;
Tim dwaroni mondo abed maler;
Gi tekoni, pong'a mi atim chir:
Mar miyo Nyingi duong' pile pile.

3. Ruoth, kaw chunya, abed mari chutho,
Pong' chunya gi herani maduong';
Kaw dwarona kod ngimana duto;
Achiwora ni In, Ruoth, bed kuoma.

4. Roho Maler, jiwruok oa kuomi:
Jiw chunya koro, ti tichni kuoma:
Isepuonja geno Wachni pile;
Gwedha koro, Ruodha, akwayoi.

1. Adwaro bet buti, Nyasaye Wuora;
Abed buti chutho, Yesu Ruodhwa.
Ndalo duto abed, buti Nyasaye Wuora;
Asik buti pile, Nyasaye Wuora.

2. Achalo gi jawuoth e piny ni ka;
Kar yueyo ongena, ler onge be.
To adwaro siko, buti Nyasaye Wuora,
Asik buti pile, Nyasaye Wuora.

3. Duto mimiya kuom ng'wononi,
Giywayo chunya chuth, abed buti;
Nyisa wang'yo mari, en e ma mond' alu;
Asik buti pile, Nyasaye Wuora.

4. Kendo gi tekona, nadend nyingi;
In Lwandana, Ruodha, In warruokna;
Kata e masira, apadora kuomi;
Asik buti pile, Nyasaye Wuora.

1. Pwodha abed maler, medna timo kinda;
Kuom dhi e masira, Kuom sin gi richo;
Medna yie moloyo mar geni chutho;
Medna mor e tichni kalami pile.

2. Chunya mond' obedi Gi erokamano,
Kapako Ruoth Yesu kod yie Wachne chuth;
Medna paro sandne kaka nothona;
Abed mamuol e tem, Ami Yesu duong'.

3. Konya gi tekoni, Alo richo duto,
Kachayo gik mag piny, Agen gi Polo.
Losa ati tichni, moloyo pile;
Abedi maler, Ruoth, kaka idwaro.

1. Pinyni ok thurwa mwageno;
Waonge dala musiko;
To wachni miyowa geno
Warito dala mabiro
Warito dala mabiro.

2. Pinyni ok thurwa mwageno;
Warito dala ma ok nen;
Zayun e nyinge—dala Ruoth;
Orieny gi ler ma nyaka chieng',
Orieny gi ler ma nyaka chieng'.

3. Dala maber mar mor gi kuwe;
Kar kuwe madier—chandruok onge.
Ruodha ariti mond' ibi,
Itera mond' ayue kanyo.
Itera mond' ayue kanyo.

4. Chunya, kuwe mos! Ruoth ong'eyo.
Ndalo ma iniyud yueyo;
E piny ka mond' adag kuom yle
Ka pod arito ndalono.
Ka pod arito ndalono.

1. Winji Jawar ni e dhoot, yie rwake, yie rwake, yie rwake;
Oseduong'o gi kinda, yie rwake, yie rwake, yie rwake.

Chorus:
Jawar ema ochungo e dhoot,
Oseng'iyo, kendo orito; (orito)
Yaw chuny mar richo malach,
Rwak Jawar maber iye, yie rwake, yie rwake.

2. En osiepni mar adier, yie rwake, yie rwake, yie rwake;
En ginyalo mar riti, yie rwake, yie rwake, yie rwake.

3. Kik oduong' kayiem nono, yie rwake, yie rwake, yie rwake;
Dipo ka ok oduogo, yie rwake, yie rwake, yie rwake.

4. Winji duonde mar hera, yie rwake, yie rwake, yie rwake;
Rwake e chunyi gi mor, yie rwake, yie rwake, yie rwake.

1. Nitie piny maber, piny mabor ngang'
Ji duto mabeyo gidak kuno.
Giwer maber kuno ka gipako Nyasachwa;
Ji duto mor kuno ndalo duto.

2. Biuru ir Yesu piyo piyo;
Utimoru nadi un mudeko;
Wanamor kuno ngang' kama ok wanakethie;
Wanasiki kuno ok wana aa.

3. Ji duto herore e pinyono;
Wuongi oritogi, oherogi,
Returu utundi, donjuru ka Ruoth maber:
Unumor kuno ngang' ndalo duto.

4. Nitie piny marach, piny marach ngang';
Ji duto maricho gidak kuno.
Gi yuak malich kuno ka gi tiyone Satan,
Ji duto yuwak kuno ndalo duto.
